Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.10,0:06:30.89,text-cn-up,,0,0,0,,波比跳
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.12,0:09:36.53,text-cn-up,,0,0,0,,浴室
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.02,0:18:28.52,text-cn-up,,0,0,0,,万里 冒失的弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.19,0:18:31.49,text-cn-up,,0,0,0,,万里 冒失的弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.49,0:18:32.99,text-cn-up,,0,0,0,,南 好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.99,0:18:33.95,text-cn-up,,0,0,0,,讴华 不可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.95,0:18:35.03,text-cn-up,,0,0,0,,清叶 冰淇淋吃到鼻上了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.53,0:18:40.24,text-cn-up,,0,0,0,,我觉得这个部分也很可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.04,0:18:46.04,text-cn-up,,0,0,0,,已储存
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.56,0:20:33.11,text-cn-up,,0,0,0,,万里 会不会是你听错了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.95,0:21:22.07,text-cn-up,,0,0,0,,收回
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.07,0:21:22.32,text-cn-up,,0,0,0,,处理中…
